title: Famine on the Rim
subtitle: Crop failures and blockades are starving Rim worlds.
tags: event
view-if: rim_hardship >= 55 and famine_timer <= 0 and not finale
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_rim.svg
on-arrival: {! Q.famine_timer = 6; Q.outer_sep += 3; Q.midrim_sep += 2; Q.faith -= 1; !}

= Famine on the Rim

Famine has struck a dozen Outer Rim systems. [? if war : War has cut their supply lanes. ?][? if not war : The guilds have raised shipping prices again. ?] Separatist agitators are telling the starving that the Republic has abandoned them, and they are not entirely wrong.

- @aid: Mount an emergency aid effort.
- @pressure: Pressure the government to act.

@aid
subtitle: −2 political capital. A real difference.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2; rim_hardship -= 5; outer_sep -= 4; outer_rc += 2; faith += 1

Caucus worlds send grain ships under their own flags.

@pressure
subtitle: Some help arrives, slowly.
on-arrival: rim_hardship -= 1.5; rc_momentum += 0.3

The government promises a relief package "in due course".
